    <string name="legal">Legal &amp; privacy</string>
    <string name="legal_text">Retrobit is an independent front-end for retro game emulators. It contains no ROMs, no advertising SDKs and no analytics. Only games you import from your own storage appear in your library. Console and game names are trademarks of their respective owners. Only use ROM files you are legally entitled to use.</string>
    <string name="made_with">Crafted for collectors, in Türkiye and beyond.</string>
    <string name="about_body">A modern home for your retro collection. Retrobit keeps your ROMs tidy, finds beautiful artwork, and hands games to your favorite emulator with a single tap.</string>
